's errors. To move forward, citizens should watch for whether proposed regulations define 'high-stakes' by the severity of individual impact rather than the industry of the developer. If a policy allows a developer to self-certify their own safety standards without independent verification, it is likely designed for compliance theater rather than public protection.",
